     <H1 style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-line-height-alt: 0pt"> </H1>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.6pt; mso-line-height-alt: 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.9600"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">2020年</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">11</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>月，绍兴市教育教学研究院公布了</FONT>2017-2019学年度绍兴市优秀教研团队评审结果。我校英语教研组和化学教研组榜上有名，双双荣获“</SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,41,65); LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>绍兴市优秀教研团队</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">”荣誉称号。接下来我们将对这些名优教研组分期报道展示，本期我们一起走进</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>化学</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>教研组。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> <A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202101/2021011013433078.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202101/2021011013433078.jpg" width=1200 height=801> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
