lt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202101/2021011013555080.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202101/2021011013555020.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202101/2021011013555008.jpg"><BR> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">    “三尺讲台育桃李，一支粉笔写春秋。” 化学组每位成员将继续不忘初心、砥砺前行，以“德教双馨”的严格标准，坚持立德树人，学科育人；以更加饱满的工作热情，勇于创新，继续用奉献和爱心书写新的辉煌诗篇！</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
